#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_status
#! frames  300
#! poster  282
#! video   no
# Run clicked: the status bar shows the iteration and a progress bar; Check input warns in a notification; the run's
# end is told in a second notification, under the first
0   move 360 200
5   move 45 42 10
15  down
17  up
60  move 360 200 15
180 move 140 42 15
200 down
202 up
220 move 360 200 15
